    <statement><p>Find the equation of the parabola with the given properties</p>
<p>Vertex <m>(0,0)</m>, focus <m>(3,0)</m>.</p>
<p><fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/><m>=x</m></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{y^{2}}{12}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>x</m>-axis rather than on the
<m>y</m>-axis,  the equation is
<m>x=\frac{{y}^{2}}{4c}</m>.

 Since
<m>c=3</m> we get
<m>x=\frac{{y}^{2}}{12}</m> or <m>x-\frac{{y}^{2}}{12}=0</m>.


</solution>
